        {
          "id": 677256752,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I would like to add the change and split out the discussion of a new man page to a new issue or perhaps to the dev list.  \nThere are more pieces to update now to get it added to https://www.wireshark.org/docs/man-pages/ and the installers(?).\n  \n[[Ethereal-dev] splitting protocol bits out of t/ethereal man pages?](https://www.wireshark.org/lists/ethereal-dev/200309/msg00616.html)  \nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/ee6cc56f586565e92f821df87161426ff7d5eaf1 - Put the display-filter elements into it's own manpage (ethereal-filter.4)",
